  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "She wears a dark blue robe. Her hair is dazzling like the milky way and droops down.",
      "chapters": [
        723
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a pavilion at the center of a lake, she plays the zither. Starlight shines brilliantly in her eyes, and her mouth shows a mysterious smile.",
      "chapters": [
        983
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "zither-portrait",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She has a tall body and wears a long blue dress that is dragged along the ground. She has long black waterfall-like hair extending to her waist. Her brows are thick and long. Her eyes are like the moon in the well, peaceful but oozing with wisdom and mystery. Her skin is white like snow. Her slender hands play the zither.",
      "chapters": [
        984
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-court",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Among rank nine Gu Immortals her lifespan of nineteen thousand years was the second longest. She created the wisdom path, a line passed down since the immemorial era with always very few practitioners, and as lord of the second generation Heavenly Court she deduced three million years ahead before she died, foresaw that Heavenly Court would stand without a lord while three Demon Venerables rose, and left three arrangements that later blocked those attacks and kept Heavenly Court intact.",
      "chapters": [
        467
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "where-she-enters-the-story",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_venerable",
        "path_wisdom",
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Her name reaches a chapter title at 723, in a title calling her appearance shocking; in that chapter her rank nine aura reads as the real deal.",
      "chapters": [
        723
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-realm-encounter",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The next chapter reveals the encounter as a piece of a dream realm.",
      "chapters": [
        724
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-realm-encounter",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 983 carries exactly the same title as chapter 723, word for word.",
      "chapters": [
        983
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-realm-encounter",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She is the second venerable in history and a disciple of Primordial Origin Immortal Venerable.",
      "chapters": [
        984
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "place-in-history",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_primordial_origin_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The dream realm chapter that exposes the encounter also names her the creator of star path.",
      "chapters": [
        724
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "path",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A later historical summary places that star path creation in the Remote Antiquity Era.",
      "chapters": [
        1323
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "path",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "evt_era_remote"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Shi Lei discovers Starry Sky grotto-heaven with her dream realm inside it, and Fang Yuan judges that unravelling it would send his own wisdom path attainment shooting up.",
      "chapters": [
        776
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "starry-sky-dream-realm",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shi_lei",
        "loc_starry_sky_grotto_heaven",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heaven Overseeing Tower is the Immortal Gu House that Star Constellation Immortal Venerable created herself.",
      "chapters": [
        948
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heaven-overseeing-towers-maker",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_heaven_overseeing_tower",
        "sys_immortal_gu_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Her song echoes in Fang Yuan’s ears again and delivers information locating a hidden Thieving Heaven true inheritance in Luo Po valley.",
      "chapters": [
        991
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "song-locates-a-true-inheritance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_thieving_heaven_true_inheritance",
        "loc_luo_po_valley"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan’s experience in Luo Po valley shows the song she sang in the dream realm bears great weight in reality, close to a prophecy.",
      "chapters": [
        993
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "song-as-prophecy",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ying Wu Xie’s rank seven lead soul into dream sends Fang Yuan into her dream realm at the pavilion on the lake, where he hears her sing again, and the dream’s difficulty is very low, seemingly because it is hers, so repeated uses of unravel dream get him out. Struck by the same killer move a second time, he finds her silent, playing only the zither.",
      "chapters": [
        1006
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-reentry-during-the-yi-tian-mountain-battle",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ying_wu_xie"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Since her death, Heaven Overseeing Tower has been Heavenly Court’s public property.",
      "chapters": [
        1009
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heaven-overseeing-tower-after-her-death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A Heavenly Court Gu Immortal says Embroidered Tower was prepared as a dowry after Primordial Origin Immortal Venerable’s disciple, Star Constellation Immortal Venerable, was betrothed.",
      "chapters": [
        1010
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "embroidered-towers-dowry-claim",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "house_embroidered_tower"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Struck again by lead soul into dream, this time the rank eight version of that killer move, Fang Yuan meets Star Constellation Immortal Venerable again at the lake pavilion, her zither playing.",
      "chapters": [
        1012
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "meeting-her-again",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Her song’s final line, that only heaven’s will remains vast and boundless through spring and autumn’s shifts of body and mind, is what delivers Fang Yuan the information that he must use change soul.",
      "chapters": [
        1019
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "the-songs-last-line",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Without switching souls on Star Constellation Immortal Venerable’s instructions, Fang Yuan would have utterly lost with no chance at a comeback.",
      "chapters": [
        1022
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "soul-swap-saved-him-from-utter-defeat",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lang Ya land spirit, who as a land spirit cannot lie, says wisdom Gu was in the past Star Constellation Immortal Venerable’s vital Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        1029
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "her-vital-gu-per-lang-ya-land-spirit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "gu_wisdom_gu",
        "sys_vital_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Venerable is rank nine. Demon Venerable names a rank nine demonic path Gu Master; Immortal Venerable names a rank nine righteous Gu Master.",
      "chapters": [
        383
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master",
        "sys_righteous_path"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "During the Remote Antiquity Era, Primordial Origin Immortal Venerable and Star Constellation Immortal Venerable appeared and led humans against the rule of variant humans.",
      "chapters": [
        912
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "era",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 1365 is titled for Star Constellation heaven’s will appearing. A lump of heaven’s will emerges from Star Constellation Chessboard and takes her appearance. She had assimilated with heaven’s will long ago. After that assimilation she is no longer herself: heaven’s will gained her form, but it remains heaven’s will in essence. Duke Long names that change a major and selfless sacrifice made to modify heaven’s will for humanity’s sake.",
      "chapters": [
        1365
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavens-will",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_star_constellation_chessboard",
        "char_duke_long"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 1379 is titled “Star Constellation’s Method”. Fairy Zi Wei’s investigative killer move draws on Immortal Gu House Star Constellation Chessboard, the method Star Constellation Immortal Venerable used in the past.",
      "chapters": [
        1379
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "her-method",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_zi_wei"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 1735 is titled “Giant Sun Versus Star Constellation”.",
      "chapters": [
        1735
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "contests-inside-heavenly-court",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When her lifespan was near its end she sacrificed herself, assimilating with the Dao so her will could participate in the operations of the Heavenly Dao and keep fate Gu in Heavenly Court’s grasp.",
      "chapters": [
        1747
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lifespan-end-sacrifice",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_heavenly_dao",
        "gu_fate_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 1935 is titled “Star Constellation Versus Limitless”.",
      "chapters": [
        1935
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "open-confrontation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A late roster of the Ten Venerables places Primordial Origin Immortal Venerable and Star Constellation Immortal Venerable in the Remote Antiquity Era, three million years before the present.",
      "chapters": [
        2085
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ten-venerables-roster",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 2183 is titled with her full name.",
      "chapters": [
        2183
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "full-name-title",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 2198 is titled “Star Constellation Versus Giant Sun”.",
      "chapters": [
        2198
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "versus-giant-sun",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 2266 is titled “Star Constellation’s Arrangement”.",
      "chapters": [
        2266
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "arrangement-title",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Late in that stretch the protagonist tells her that if she does not retreat, he will need her to die.",
      "chapters": [
        2307
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dream-realm-demand",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 2334 is titled for Fang Yuan and Giant Sun fighting her. That chapter is the novel’s last published chapter, and the fight is still underway when it ends.",
      "chapters": [
        2334
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
